# Local-only spec companions (real financial figures, fixtures)
# The acceptance suite asserts against real account totals (pending balances,
# the size of the reversal), so it stays local alongside the fixtures it reads.
# It cannot run without `fixtures/local/` anyway — it skips when they are absent.
*.local.md
*.local.test.ts
fixtures/local/

# Electron shell: dependencies and build output.
# `dist/` here is the packaged app — a 119 MB AppImage and an 83 MB pacman
# package, both reproducible from source by `electron-builder`.
electron/node_modules/
electron/dist/
